parameters.description:
The data to write. The value is a JSON structure in the following fixed format:

```
{
    "key1": {
        "value":xxx1
        "time":yyy1
    },
    "key2": {
        "value":xxx2
        "time":yyy2
    }
}
```

- **key1** and **key2** are field identifiers. Each **Items** can contain multiple fields.
- **value** is the value of the field. Supported data types are int32, float, double, text, date, bool, enum, struct, and array. For more information, see [Supported data types](~~358843~~).
- **time**: the UTC timestamp of the field value, in milliseconds.
